  <notepads>
    <notepad>
      <note>enrich_descriptions - finds the weak product descriptions in ../catalog.csv and has the model write new
ones from the title, brand, category and price only.
Needs Ollama with ${MODEL_NAME} and a GENAI-EE license.

1. csvi-catalog: CSV file input, ../catalog.csv.
2. js-quality: Modified JavaScript value, quality_issue = empty, too short (under 25 characters) or all caps;
   null when the description is fine.
3. flt-weak: Filter rows, quality_issue IS NOT NULL; the others are dropped.
4. js-prompt: Modified JavaScript value, prompt = Title, Brand, Category and Price lines.
5. const-instruction: Add constants, run_instruction: use only the record's facts, no new numbers, two
   sentences, no price, answer in JSON.
6. ai-describe: AI Chat, Stream, message prompt, instruction run_instruction, Ollama ${MODEL_NAME},
   temperature 0, numCtx 2048, timeout 120, result llm_json.
7. json-describe: JSON input from llm_json: new_description ($.description), basis. Error hop to
   txt-bad-answers (bad_answers.csv).
8. js-check-facts: Modified JavaScript value, unsupported_numbers = numbers in new_description that are
   not in the record.
9. sv-enriched, txt-enriched: enriched_descriptions.csv beside this file.</note>
      <xloc>160</xloc>
      <yloc>32</yloc>
      <width>624</width>
      <heigth>332</heigth>
      <fontname>Segoe UI</fontname>
      <fontsize>10</fontsize>
      <fontbold>N</fontbold>
      <fontitalic>N</fontitalic>
      <fontcolorred>0</fontcolorred>
      <fontcolorgreen>0</fontcolorgreen>
      <fontcolorblue>0</fontcolorblue>
      <backgroundcolorred>167</backgroundcolorred>
      <backgroundcolorgreen>224</backgroundcolorgreen>
      <backgroundcolorblue>245</backgroundcolorblue>
      <bordercolorred>100</bordercolorred>
      <bordercolorgreen>100</bordercolorgreen>
      <bordercolorblue>100</bordercolorblue>
      <drawshadow>Y</drawshadow>
    </notepad>
  </notepads>
